OL,3,GNEWSAUK flight delays continue after
OL,4,Aissue with air traffic control in
OL,5,AScotland is resolved
OL,6,
OL,7,FA "technical issue" with air traffic
OL,8,Fcontrol in Scotland which has been
OL,9,Fcausing delays to flights in the UK has
OL,10,Fbeen resolved, but disruption
OL,11,Fcontinues.
OL,13,FThe national air traffic service (Nats)
OL,14,Fsaid engineers were called in to deal
OL,15,Fwith the issue at the Prestwick Centre
OL,16,Fin South Ayrshire which handles air
OL,17,Ftraffic control across Scotland and the
OL,18,Fnorth of England.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,422,420,260,160,0,100
