OL,3,GNEWSAUK flight delays continue after
OL,4,Aissue with air traffic control in
OL,5,AScotland is resolved
OL,6,
OL,7,FA spokesperson for Nats said the issue
OL,8,Fhad now been resolved and they were
OL,9,Fworking with airlines to safely lift
OL,10,Fair traffic regulations and minimise
OL,11,Ffurther disruption.
OL,13,FThe service said the issue was not
OL,14,Frelated to a software defect that led
OL,15,Fto the cancellation of 2,000 flights
OL,16,Facross the UK earlier this month.
